WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.544
Three of the four original claims hold: the model
beats the variational-autoencoder baseline on every dynamical task,

00:00:07.624 --> 00:00:13.082
reaches near-perfect accuracy on trees, and its
forward pass grows sub-quadratically.

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:17.318
The fourth fails: backward passes were claimed to
scale linearly,

00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:20.250
but the fitted exponent is clearly above one.
